{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Radio said the army would reach Muldraugh, that was three days ago - we keep waiting"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"A neighbor said the highway is blocked at the bridge - we stayed in"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=careful",{"I don't know anything - please don't ask"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_elder|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard the church on Elm took people in, haven't heard back since","The radio went quiet two days ago, nothing since but static"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I heard there's a safe zone at the fairgrounds, could be a rumor","The Guard was rounding people up at the school, folks say they've left"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=careful",{"I don't trade in rumors"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_loner|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=fire",{"Smoke on the north ridge - don't know what's burning, I'd stay away"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_loner|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Nothing I'd tell a stranger"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plant's shut - Management's gone, nobody knows who's in charge"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,road",{"Truck driver came through, said the interstate is a parking lot for miles"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_firefighter|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dispatch has been silent since Tuesday, that's all I know"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_firefighter|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"We don't discuss calls with strangers"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_medical|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"The hospital is overrun - don't go, they said the evacuation was canceled"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_medical|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"No news that I'm willing to share"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Parishioners told me there's a gathering at the high school - I haven't seen it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"The Lord's silent, so am I"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dispatch is gone, last word was an evacuation order for Rosewood","Roadblocks at both ends of the county, nobody gets through without a pass"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"News goes to officials, not to you"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"State's declared an emergency, of course it has, that's all I get on the radio","The Guard is supposedly setting up at the high school - I'm waiting for a confirmation"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"I'll tell you when you need to know"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Interstate's closed in both directions, nobody's moving a mile"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=careful|world=road",{"Highway is closed, that's the news"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard prisoners got loose at the state facility - keep your head up"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Ask my officer, news goes up the chain"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have a report I'd trust enough to send you anywhere"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Classified"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"We hold the line, that's the news"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=careful",{"I'm not permitted to say"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Orders are to hold, command hasn't updated us in days"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Not for you to hear"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard the Guard fell apart, whole companies left their posts"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"News? I quit listening, it never helped me"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=elite_operator,elite_delta,mercenary|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not much, and what I have, I don't share"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=elite_operator,elite_delta,mercenary|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"No"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Heard there's a toll on the Ekron road, pay, or go around"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Folks are saying the dead don't sleep at night, I'd believe it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"News costs - what've you got?"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Word is there's a convoy loaded with food on the highway"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"Ask somebody who likes you"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=gang_member,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Word on the block: the cops are gone, whole city belongs to whoever's got guns"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=gang_member,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"I ain't your newspaper"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=water,road",{"Riders from the east say the roads are clear past the river - no guarantee"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=careful",{"We hear things, we don't share"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's a man in town paying for information, it could be worth your while"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Information has a price, you can't afford it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard the guards ran off, whole wing was open, we just walked out"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"Why? You a snitch?"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral|hour=20,5",{"Heard a bell ring in Riverside at midnight, nobody rang it - believe what you like"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"The TV said stay indoors and that was it, then it went to that horrible tone, and now it's just snow","Somebody's cousin heard the Guard is setting up a line somewhere past the river, but that was yesterday","They keep saying \"contain\" on the radio, contain what? CONTAIN WHAT?","There's something wrong with the hospitals, my neighbor's a nurse, she said they're full, FULL","Nobody's telling us anything, it's all \"remain calm,\" I'm calm, I'm so calm I could scream","Somebody said it's the whole county, not just here... but who knows, it's all rumor","The sheriff's office was on the scanner till last night, then nothing, just a hum","I heard it's a chemical thing, someone said a truck spilled, I don't know, I don't KNOW"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"No real news, the radio just plays a recording on a loop, I could say it in my sleep","Heard the Army pulled back from the bridge, that means they're not coming, doesn't it? doesn't it?","People say there's a safe place, but nobody can tell me where it is, only that it's \"that way\"","A man came through yesterday, said Louisville is gone, just gone, burned, he wouldn't stop shaking!","I've heard it's spread to Tennessee, and Indiana, and I don't know if I believe it","Lots of rumors, none of them good, the best one is that it's all a drill, can you imagine"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nothing new, which is the news, nothing changes, the dead walk, the living hide","Radio's been quiet, except that one voice, you know the one, reading names","Rumor is a convoy's coming through, I've heard that rumor eleven times now","People are saying the dead are slowing down, and I want to believe it, I really do","Someone said there's a place where they're handing out food, I'm not going, I've been burned...","The only real news is who's still breathing at the end of the week, and it's fewer each time","There's talk of a cold front coming, which is the first good thing I've heard in weeks"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly",{"Come here, sit, I've got a little, it's not much, but I'll tell you what I heard, and you tell me yours","Nothing I can swear to. I don't want to send you chasing something that isn't there","I trust you, so here goes, there's a group moving south, and they're not friendly"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"I don't have any news for you","Why? so you can sell it to somebody else?!","If I knew anything, I wouldn't TELL you!","Ask someone who's lying to you, I don't lie"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_loner",{"Heard shooting up north, two days ago, then it stopped, which means somebody won or everybody lost..","Smoke over the ridge yesterday, big smoke, whole town, I'd say, I didn't go look","Nothing new, they're slow in the cold, they're quick in the heat, and it's been hot","Folks are traveling in packs now, forty, fifty strong, taking whatever they want","Word is the soldiers left a camp behind, empty, full of supplies, but also full of bad luck","Rumor's a man on the river is trading ammo for canned goods, I wouldn't bet on it","Birds quit singing near the highway, and that's all I need to know about the highway","Heard that the dead don't cross water, which is bull, I watched one walk through a creek"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"News? from me? that's rich","I don't talk news, news talks!","News? I don't trade in it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Our neighbor's radio picked up something... a woman reading a list of names, we listened, we cried","They say it's an infection, the doctors said it's an infection, but they don't know what kind","My brother-in-law says the Army's got a plan... and I told him if there's a plan, where are they?","They said stay home... so we stayed home, and now the home's the problem..","I heard the highway is blocked both ways, nobody gets in or out, so we're stuck, aren't we","My mother heard it on the church phone tree, before the phones died, that it's everywhere, even Indiana","Nothing that'd make a kid feel better, so I'm not telling you, I'm sorry"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_elder",{"Honey, I've heard so many rumors I could knit a quilt out of 'em","The radio said something about quarantine, quarantine, like it's a dog with fleas","Nobody tells an old woman anything, they think I'll worry, I worry anyway","My granddaughter told me it's on the news in every state, but then the news went off","Back in '57 we had the flu, they closed the schools, but not the churches, now they close everything"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_youth",{"So, like, there's a rumor the soldiers are shooting anyone who crosses the line, but that's probably fake","Somebody said it's a government thing, some experiment, but that sounds like a movie, right?","My friend's dad says it's rabies, but rabies doesn't do THIS","I heard it's gonna be over by Friday, someone said, and I'm choosing to believe them"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=worker",{"Rumor at the plant is they've got a generator running at the county hospital, and that's where the sick go","Heard the railroad's shut down, no trains, no freight, and when the freight stops, the world stops","Truckers on the CB say the interstate is a parking lot, abandoned, thousands of cars","The power company guys say the grid is going, brownouts, then blackouts, then silence","Nothing good, all of it bad, worse every day, I'm not in the mood to repeat it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_medical",{"Hospitals are overwhelmed, and the ones that aren't are empty, and I don't know which is worse..","The county health department sent one memo, one, it said \"isolate the bitten,\" that's all","Heard there's a vaccine, heard that three times, the only thing I believe is that people want to","If you're bitten... don't come to me expecting miracles, I've seen what it does, there's no cure","Rumor is they're evacuating the elderly, but none of the buses showed"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy",{"There are stories of kindness, too, a man in the next county gave away his whole larder","I pray for news every morning, and every morning the answer is silence","The bishop's office was gone when I called... that tells me enough","People are arriving at the church with terrible stories... but also with casseroles -- if you can believe it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Dispatch went dark, then came back with a recording, then went dark again","Nobody in command, nobody giving orders, we're all making it up","Rumor is a squad out at the fairgrounds is coordinating, I'm not sure I believe it","Smoke over the river, and no engines responding, because no engines are left"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=militia",{"Rumor is the Guard abandoned their post at the bridge, and we're on our own","Heard a plane go over last night, a big one, not a passenger plane, heading north","Somebody said the sheriff is dead, somebody else said he's the one running the show, take your pick","Local news says nothing, the national news says nothing, which tells me something"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You've earned a straight answer, so... part of this I know, part I'm guessing","Sit down, I'll give you the whole thing, it's not pretty, but you deserve the truth","You first, what have you heard? then I'll fill in the blanks, I trust you!!","For you? Everything I've got, sit down, it's not pretty, but it's true","You ask, I tell, that's how it works between us, here's what I heard","I wouldn't share this with just anybody, but you've earned it!","Word is there's a convoy on the north road, nobody I know trusts it","You're the first person I'd tell, a man came through yesterday, said the river line is breaking","I heard two things, one good, one awful, which first? never mind, the awful one, you can take it","Some of this I know, some I'm guessing, I'll say which","There's a rumor about a camp to the east, and I want your opinion, you're sharp","News? Quiet, mostly, but the quiet's changing, you can feel it","A trader told me the dead are gathering in town, in big numbers, avoid the center","I'd tell you even if you hadn't asked, there's a patrol moving through, armed, not ours","The radio said something last night, I wrote it down, hang on, here","People are talking about you, you know, good talk, the kind that helps","You hear the bell? no? it rang at dawn from the old chapel, three times, and nobody knows who rang it","I've got news, small news, but it's something: the creek's running clear again","Folks say there's a clinic open two towns over, I'm going to check it, want to come?","Somebody saw a helicopter, two days ago, heading south, low, I wanted to run after it","The word is, the checkpoint at the bridge is empty, but I wouldn't trust it","I heard about a family that made it out, up to Indiana, I want to believe it","Sit, sit, I'll tell you, you deserve to know, you've been square with us","Here's a bit that might help you: avoid the main highway, there's a gang on it!","Sheriff's office has a few men left, they're okay, they're fair, you can approach them","The day before yesterday, someone left food on the church steps, no note, just food","A woman on the radio is reading names every night at nine, if you listen, you might hear someone you know","I overheard a group talking about a safe place with real walls, I couldn't catch where","A man says he saw lights in the hills, three nights in a row, signals maybe!","I trust you with this: they're building a barricade at the crossroads, and they're hungry for recruits!","The bad news is it's getting worse, the good news is you're not alone in it!","Not a thing. I'd tell you if I had something worth passing on","I won't lie, it's grim, but I'll tell you every bit, because you're a friend"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"I don't share news with people like you","Whatever I know, you don't deserve it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|rep=bad,worst",{"Get away from me with that question"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"News?! There's no news, there's only screaming, I heard it through the wall all night","I- I heard something on the radio, a voice, it said \"do not\" and then it just- stopped","Don't ask me, I don't want to KNOW, every bit of news I've heard has been worse","Shhh! quiet! okay, okay, the only thing I heard is that they're moving at night, in numbers","Something about the bridge... people running... I turned the dial off, I couldn't, couldn't","Please don't tell me any news, please, I just got my breathing right","They said it's spreading, they said it's everywhere, they said- God, I don't even know who \"they\" is"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"Same as yesterday, worse than yesterday, better than tomorrow","Nobody's saying anything new, only the same names, the same places, the same numbers","Smoke to the north, quiet to the south, that's my news","News is for people who still have somewhere to go","A few more dead, a few less living, you do the math","Heard another group gave up, walked out into the road, hands up"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"The only news I care about is whether my daughter's alive... and nobody can tell me that","Friend of mine died yesterday... that's the news... Pete, from the garage... that's all I've got","I keep waiting for a name on the radio, a name I know, and I keep dreading it too","Nothing... nothing good... nothing I'd want to say out loud"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"News?! The news is that they LIED to us, that's the news, they knew and they lied!","News? Some guy in an office decided we weren't worth saving, there you go","You want news? I'll give you news, nobody's coming, nobody ever WAS coming","Every word out of that radio was a lie, and I believed it, God damn it, I believed it!"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Come here, sit, I've been saving what I heard for someone I could trust, and that's you","It's not great news, but it's news, and I'd rather share it with you than keep it alone","I did hear one good thing, honest to God, one, and I'm dying to tell somebody"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"News? The latest is that my cat is still a jerk, and the apocalypse is still a pain, no change, heh!","Big news... I found a clean sock, yesterday, a clean one, I cried, hahaha!","Well... there's good news and bad news, good news is I'm alive, bad news is you're asking me","Big news, I found a clean towel yesterday","Latest from the radio: static... followed by more static, with a brief intermission","Word around the campfire is the end of the world was a Friday","The big news is the fish are biting","Word is, the mayor ran off with the town treasury"},false,false,{[4]={{t="I've been telling everybody",afterMs=3000},{t="nobody's impressed",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="of static",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="that checks out, I had plans",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="if you've got a hook and no dignity",afterMs=3200}},[8]={{t="the treasury being forty dollars and a coffee can",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|mood=fear",{"I'm not telling you anything... and I don't want to hear any of yours","News? From a stranger? No thanks, no thanks, please keep walking"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"News? Bits, one patient at a time, and every bit's worse than the last","A man came in Tuesday, talking about the Army, I had to sedate him, so, take that as you will","Nobody's briefing the nurses, we're just supposed to keep going, so, we keep going...","The newest thing I know is that the fevers peak at hour six, and then... then it's over","Heard another clinic closed... no more doctors, no more anything, I try not to think about it","Honest answer? No news is the news, and it's killing me"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"News? The only news I give is a diagnosis, and you're not a patient"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"News for you? Nothing","I wouldn't tell you if the sky was falling","Ask someone who likes you","No news, and if there were, you wouldn't hear it from me","The only news is that people like you aren't welcome","I've heard plenty, and none of it's yours to hear","Rumors travel, and yours traveled faster than mine","You want information? Earn some trust first","Nope, nothing, go away!","I don't gossip with people like you","News is for friends, and you're not one","There's news about you -- though, not good","Everyone's talking about you, and none of it's flattering","Don't ask me, ask your conscience","If I knew where the trouble was, I'd point you straight at it","I keep what I know to myself, around you especially!!","The latest news is that you're still around, unfortunately","I won't spoil your day with news, nor ruin MINE!","Look around, you'll see the news","Why? you can't read the writing on the wall?","Get your information elsewhere","I'd sooner tell the dead than tell you","Don't waste my time!","You're not on my list of people who get told things","My news is not your news!","The word is, stay away from you, and that's all I've got","Ask me again, and I'll tell you where to go","If I said something, you'd twist it","Whatever I heard, it's not for you","Not today, not tomorrow, not ever"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"News? THIS is the news, they're right there, look!","No time... NO time, they're close, be quiet","The latest is that they're outside, go look","Ask me in a minute, ask me when we're safe","News? Run, that's the news, run","The only news is the groaning, hear it?","Sorry, can't talk, can't think, they're too close","News- later- I'm busy being scared"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_human_contact",{"News? Maybe, I just saw somebody, I don't know who, hold on","Heard voices a minute ago, real people, so quiet","People are about, people we don't know, that's today's news"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard a rumor about a camp with a fence and a cook tent","A man came through yesterday, said Louisville's burning","Somebody on the radio said \"stay put\"","There's talk of a convoy","I heard the Guard left the river bridge","Somebody saw lights over the ridge, three nights in a row","They say the dead are slower in the cold","A woman told me the hospitals filled up in an hour","Everybody swears there's a safe zone","Word is a group down south has a working well and a wall","Nothing new, really","Folks are saying it was an accident at some plant","I heard a baby cry last night -- from a house I thought was empty..","A man told me the president's in a bunker","They say the rain's poison","Somebody's reading names on the radio at night","I heard a plane today, high up, going west","There's talk of a vaccine","My neighbor says it's the end times","A trucker on the CB said the highways are jammed solid... both ways","I heard they're burning the dead in the stadium","Rumor is the sheriff's holding out in the courthouse","The man at the crossroads says the bridge fell","I heard singing from the next valley","Folks are trading rumors for bread","A boy came down off the ridge yesterday, hungry, filthy","Somebody left a note on the church door..","They say the power's coming back Thursday","I heard the dead drown","Rain's coming, my knee says","A woman at the well said the Army shot a family at the checkpoint","Two kids came through selling matches, ten cents a box","The preacher's started giving two sermons a day...","They say somewhere there's still ice, and a man selling it","Heard a baby cry last night","There's talk of a trade day at the fairgrounds"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...or maybe I dreamed it, I dream a lot of soup now",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="he wouldn't look at me when he said it",afterMs=3500},{t="I think he had people there",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="and then it cut off mid-word",afterMs=3000},{t="that's all the radio's said to me in three days",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="there's always talk of a convoy",afterMs=3200},{t="nobody's ever seen the convoy",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="if that's true, nobody's holding anything",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="could be people, could be signals, could be nothing",afterMs=3500},{t="I'm not going to find out",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="I'm choosing to believe it",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="she was a nurse, she wasn't lying",afterMs=3500},{t="I wish she were",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="nobody can say where",afterMs=3500},{t="that's how I know it's a story",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="word is also that they shoot visitors",afterMs=3500},{t="so, you pick",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="which is the worst kind of news, honestly",afterMs=3000}},[12]={{t="folks always say that",afterMs=3500},{t="nobody ever says \"we did it on purpose\"",afterMs=3000}},[13]={{t="I stood there for ten minutes",afterMs=3500},{t="I didn't go in",afterMs=3000}},[14]={{t="I said, good for him",afterMs=3200},{t="he didn't laugh",afterMs=2800}},[15]={{t="I drank it anyway",afterMs=3000},{t="I'm still here, so, there you go",afterMs=2800}},[16]={{t="I listen every night",afterMs=3500},{t="I'm afraid I'll hear one I know, and afraid I won't",afterMs=3000}},[17]={{t="nobody waved",afterMs=3200},{t="nobody was close enough to",afterMs=2800}},[18]={{t="there's always talk",afterMs=3000},{t="I'll believe it when someone I know is cured",afterMs=2800}},[19]={{t="my neighbor says a lot of things",afterMs=3200},{t="he's been right more than I'd like",afterMs=2800}},[20]={{t="nobody's going anywhere",afterMs=3500},{t="including him",afterMs=3000}},[21]={{t="I don't know which stadium",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't want to",afterMs=3000}},[22]={{t="I hope so",afterMs=3500},{t="somebody should be holding something",afterMs=3000}},[23]={{t="he'd had a drink, so, grain of salt",afterMs=3500}},[24]={{t="a whole choir",afterMs=3200},{t="I thought, maybe a church found a way",afterMs=2800}},[25]={{t="a rumor for a heel, a better rumor for a loaf",afterMs=3500}},[26]={{t="said there's a hundred of them in the hollow",afterMs=3200},{t="he wouldn't say more",afterMs=3000}},[27]={{t="\"We went east\"",afterMs=3500},{t="that's all, nobody knows who \"we\" is",afterMs=3000}},[28]={{t="they've said Thursday since Thursday",afterMs=3200}},[29]={{t="that you can lose them at the river. I'm not trusting a story with my life",afterMs=3500},{t="I haven't tested it",afterMs=3000}},[30]={{t="that's the only forecast I trust",afterMs=3200}},[31]={{t="she'd lost her voice",afterMs=3500},{t="telling it",afterMs=3000}},[32]={{t="ten cents!",afterMs=3200},{t="I gave them a dollar and a hug",afterMs=2800}},[33]={{t="folks need to hear a voice more than a message",afterMs=3500}},[34]={{t="I don't know where, but I'm sure it's a lie, and I'd still walk there",afterMs=3200}},[35]={{t="really cry, loud, healthy",afterMs=3500},{t="the whole street sat up and listened",afterMs=3000}},[36]={{t="no guns, they say",afterMs=3200},{t="I'll believe it when I see it",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"I heard a church bell this morning, far off"},false,false,{[1]={{t="rang eleven times, then stopped",afterMs=3500},{t="I counted",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come sit, I'll tell you what I know, and you tell me what you know","I save my news for people I like!!","I save the good rumors for people I like"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's how we all learn",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="lucky you",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="sit, I'll share",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"News from me? Not a chance","Why, you collecting gossip?","Why?","News is currency","You're asking a lot of questions for a stranger","I don't talk to people I don't know!","Ask someone who trusts you","I've heard plenty","Nothing","I'm not trading news with you","News is I don't know you, that's all the news today"},false,false,{[3]={{t="who do you work for?",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="and I don't hand it out",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="that's rule one",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="and none of it's for you",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="next question",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Birds are leaving the valley","Deer are moving at midday now","I saw a fire three ridges over","Heard the dogs howling all night -- whole county, like a choir","River's low","Saw a man on the trail, coughing blood","Squirrels are fat this year","Coyotes are bold","No human news"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's all the news I trust",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="something's pushing them",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="burned two days, then went out",afterMs=3500},{t="nobody came",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="fish are gone",afterMs=3200},{t="I don't ask why",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="told him to keep walking",afterMs=3500},{t="I'm not proud",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="that's the good news",afterMs=3200}},[8]={{t="come right up to the porch",afterMs=3500},{t="they smell what I smell",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="the woods don't gossip",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey, the last news I got was from the preacher, and he'd been drinking","My granddaughter used to tell me the news","I heard on the old radio that they're closing the schools","Sister Mabel says it's the end times","They say it's catching","The paper stopped coming"},false,false,{[1]={{t="he said the world was ending",afterMs=3500},{t="I told him it was just Tuesday",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="she's not here anymore",afterMs=3500},{t="so I make it up",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="which is funny, because the schools are already closed",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="Sister Mabel has said that since 1962",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="everybody says it's catching",afterMs=3200},{t="I say, so's a smile",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="that's how I knew it was serious",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"I don't gossip with strangers"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Rumor is the Army's setting up something at the high school","Somebody said there's a party at the quarry","I heard the principal got bit","Nobody tells us anything","The radio guy keeps saying \"remain calm\".."},false,false,{[1]={{t="but my friend says that's a trap",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="which, like, in this??",afterMs=3200},{t="people are weird",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="and I'm not even sorry",afterMs=3500},{t="okay, I'm a little sorry",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="adults just say \"it's fine\"",afterMs=3200},{t="it's NOT fine",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="I hate that guy",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"Depends who's asking"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Union guy told me the plants are all shut, every one","Truckers on the CB say the interstate's one big parking lot...","The foreman said we'd be called back Monday","Lights flicker at the plant every night","Railroad stopped","Heard the gas stations are dry... all of them"},false,false,{[1]={{t="nobody's getting paid",afterMs=3500},{t="not that pay matters",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="and the parking lot's full of people trying to leave",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="that's the last I heard from him",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="somebody's still running the generator",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't know who",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="no trains since Sunday",afterMs=3200},{t="you notice the quiet",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="which means nobody's driving anywhere",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=worker|st=careful",{"News? Ask the foreman"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Neighbor says the schools are closed through September","My wife's cousin works at the hospital","We listened to the Emergency Broadcast tone for six hours straight","They say it's a flu"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I laughed",afterMs=3500},{t="then I cried",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="she said don't come",afterMs=3200},{t="don't come for any reason",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="the kids thought it was a game",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="it's not a flu",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"People tell me things in the church","A woman came in last night, whispering about a camp to the north","The bell rang by itself at midnight","I pray for news every dawn, and the news is always the same: that I am here, and so are you"},false,false,{[1]={{t="they tell the walls, really, and I happen to be standing there",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I told her to rest first, news second",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="I know, I know, the wind",afterMs=3500},{t="it was a still night",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"I buried a man this morning who had something to say"},false,false,{[1]={{t="he never got to say it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"I hear confessions, not gossip"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Radio's chattering about a fire at the refinery","I heard a blast last night, east side","Dispatch said a unit was lost near the river","Our chief went out on a call Tuesday"},false,false,{[1]={{t="nobody's responding",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I counted sixty seconds before the smoke",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="nobody's said whose",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="he hasn't come back",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"Fire news is firehouse news!"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Perimeter's holding, mostly","A patrol came back with three fewer than they left with","The captain says to hold","Word from the next post is quiet"},false,false,{[1]={{t="two breaches this week, both patched",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="nothing else",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="too quiet",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't love quiet",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=militia|st=careful",{"Classified, friend"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"It was on the TV two days ago, the anchor's voice kept cracking","Nobody knows anything yet -- that's the news...","They keep saying \"contained,\" CONTAINED","The sirens haven't stopped since Friday","My brother called, said the hospital's a zoo","This is brand new, brand new, we're all in the dark together..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="then he just stopped talking",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="while the whole street is screaming",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="that was the last time he called",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"A week in, and still no official word","People are starting to move, in packs, south","The radio's down to a recording now","I heard the first camp got overrun","Rumor is the Guard abandoned the river line"},false,false,{[1]={{t="no helicopters, no loudspeakers, nothing",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="it loops every twenty minutes",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="nobody's said which",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"It's weeks now, weeks, and nothing new","News dried up long ago","The only news is who's still alive..","We're on our own, and we've known that for a while","Nothing from outside in a month"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I stopped asking",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="now it's just rumors, and rumors of rumors",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="and who isn't",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="I don't expect any",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"News? I'm the news, {g:pal|lady}, and what I'm telling you is turn around","Only news is the dead are winning and the rest of us are too scared to say it out loud","Heard some guys got hit up the road, lost everything, shame, really","You want news, it'll cost you, information's worth more than ammo these days","Last I heard, somebody's selling antibiotics out of a house on the ridge, nobody's confirmed it","Rumor is the Army's pulling out, rumor is they're coming back, rumor is whatever you want it to be","Everyone's got a story, nobody's got proof, I stopped listening yesterday","Two trucks went through here yesterday, didn't stop, didn't say a word, make of that what you will"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You want news? Here's news: you're about to be on the ground!","News is you're annoying me, and that's never good for the person doing it"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I got nothing good, {g:man|lady}, it's all bad and getting worse, wish I could tell you something better","I heard there's a camp somewhere north, I want to believe it so bad, but I'm scared to go and see"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Information is currency in my business, and you haven't got anything I want yet"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Word on the street is the Army's cleaning up Louisville, burning whole blocks","Heard some crew got hit last night, lost everybody, that's what happens when you get careless","Folks say there's food at the church on the corner, but I ain't going to find out the hard way","Nobody knows nothing, everybody's guessing","Man, I heard they're shooting looters at the checkpoints, so we don't loot there","There was gunfire over by the water tower, I ain't going to look"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"The only news I have for you is \"get out of here\""}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Heard a guy on the radio saying help was coming, I wanna believe him, but I don't know"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Brothers up north say the highway's completely blocked, nothing getting through","Heard a rumor the base is sending out patrols, haven't seen one yet","Rumor mill's working overtime, but nobody's saying anything useful","Some old-timer swears the water's contaminated, I'd rather not find out"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=club|st=hostile",{"You want news, go ask somebody else, I'm not your informant"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Not much good to share, {g:brother|sister}, but if I hear something I'll let you know"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I hear a great deal, but I share very little","Always rumors, half of 'em dumb, I only trust what I see myself","A gentleman I know tells me the military is shifting positions, though I can't verify that","Information costs, but for the right price I might remember something"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"You are not in a position to ask me for news"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Nothing I'd call reliable, but I'll keep my ears open for you"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"News? I got out of a concrete box a few days ago, I don't know anything","Everybody's talking about a camp up north, but I won't go, they'll ask for ID","Heard a guy got shot at a roadblock, don't know if it's true","I only know what I see: more dead, less food, no cops"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Why? Who wants to know? You working with the Army?!"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I wish I had good news, I really do, I could use some myself"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing good, nothing you haven't already guessed","Heard from a trucker the interstate's a parking lot of dead cars, so stay off it","Rumor says there's a doctor in Elizabethtown, running a little clinic out of a church basement","Fella came through yesterday, said Bardstown's overrun, take that for what it's worth"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"If I hear something, I'll let you know, scout's honor"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't have any news, and I'm not asking for any"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"We've received no official news in days","Last communication said stay put and wait for further instruction, that was Sunday","Reports are coming in from all over, but none we can verify","We heard reports of survivors gathering at the courthouse, and we're trying to confirm"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law|st=hostile",{"No news for civilians, please return to your shelter"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I wish I had more to tell you, honestly, I'd share every scrap"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"What I hear, I don't repeat, until it's confirmed, too many rumors out there already"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"No news, move along","Updates are provided through official channels only","Situation is developing, that's all I can share"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Nothing for civilians, return to your position"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Wish I had better news, honestly"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing I can tell you that'll help"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I heard... I heard some of our guys went AWOL, I don't know if it's true, please don't tell"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing that concerns you"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"News is for people with time to waste"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Neighbors say there's trouble on the east road, but nobody's checked it out","Heard the church in the next town took in some folks, we're considering it","Radio says stay inside, but how can you stay inside when your livestock is outside"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come by the farm, we swap stories over soup"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Just saw one of the dead close by, kinda more interested in that right now","A dead one was nearby - Louisville? No idea, barely know what's going on here","News? I just saw one of those things - don't stop looking around on my account","One of the dead was close - can we talk somewhere else?","Just spotted a dead one - close, past that, I dunno"},false,{[4]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","fact=recent_human_contact",{"Ran into trouble near here - recent, I can't tell you where they've gone","Someone hostile was close by - don't ask how many more there are, I didn't see","Just had trouble with somebody - keep it down a bit, would you?","Trouble close by, people, not the dead - wouldn't stand around talking out here","Saw someone hostile around here myself, didn't hear it off somebody else"},false,{[3]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral",{"{den} - heard about that place? Wouldn't go there expecting a warm welcome","If you're asking about dangerous people, {den}, that's the place I've heard about","People talk about {den}, I wouldn't go looking just to find out how much of the story is true","Heard about a working freezer, asked who'd actually seen it and, uh... nobody knew, so don't get excited","Some church was taking people in, somebody said, didn't know which church - helpful, huh?"},false,{[5]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Heard something about {den}","{den}, that's where I'd start being careful, not where I'd start looking for a free meal"},false,false,{[1]={{t="No, I'm not going with you, just telling you what I heard",afterMs=2400}}}},
{"ASK_NEWS","tmp=fresh|day=0,7",{"Everybody keeps asking me what's happening - me! I'm asking THEM!","Nothing reliable, can't even tell you what time it is without checking again"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=worker,civilian|day=0,7",{"I keep asking whether work's canceled - work, like I'm going to be written up for not coming in"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7",{"Just want somebody to tell me they made it home - anything like that - you heard anything?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=0,7",{"People keep saying 'when this is over.' I keep saying it too - don't know what else to say yet","A guy with a clipboard tells me something and I believe him - why? It's a fucking clipboard"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=0,7|world=road",{"Heard so much stuff I can't remember what was on the radio and what some guy told me in a parking lot"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=0,14",{"If somebody says they know exactly what started this, ask how - nobody's given me a good answer yet","Everybody's real sure about something different, I haven't got a damn clue"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7|world=rain",{"I still listen for a normal weather forecast, just rain, mowing the yard, that kind of problem"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=14,45",{"Still waiting for 'temporary' to be over - anyone given you a date? Yeah, me neither"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=14,3650",{"Used to ask when help was coming, now I just... hope somebody answers","Ask when it happened first, half the stories people tell me are old before I hear 'em"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=worker,civilian|day=31,3650",{"No big news, I repaired something instead of throwing it away today, that's about my scale now"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","day=31,3650|world=road",{"Who's in charge? Hell if I know, just wanna know who's blocking whichever road I need next"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral|day=7,3650",{"Help's coming tomorrow - heard that one? Heard it yesterday too"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","st=friendly,neutral,careful|world=road",{"Same evacuation story, three different roads, can't tell you which version's wrong, probably all of 'em"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law,military,rescue",{"If you've got something, tell me when it happened and who saw it - need more than 'someone said'"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"They said on the radio the Guard's setting up in Muldraugh - so that's good - that's good news, isn't it?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nothing good, the Abernathy boy came home last night, if you know what I mean - his mama let him in"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,10",{"Man on the CB said they're airlifting children out of Rosewood - I don't know if it's true, I want it to be true so bad"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=family|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=cars",{"Only news I've got is ours, daddy's insulin ran out Wednesday - anyway - you seen any cars that still run?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family|st=friendly,neutral|day=8,9999|world=fence",{"News is whatever somebody shouts over a fence, yesterday it was West Point burned down, today they say it didn't"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Word is a group took over the gas station out on 31W - charging a can of food to pass - go around","News is the same every day, fewer of us, more of them, and the water's getting low"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=fire",{"Fella came through yesterday said they're burning bodies at the county line - you can smell it from the bridge"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker|st=careful",{"I'll trade you news for news, you go first, and you do it from right there"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Here's some news for you - you're leaving"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard the grain elevator in West Point still has diesel - heard it from a guy who wanted me to go fetch it for him","Nothing since the plant radio died, man on my shift kept a transistor in his lunchbox - that was all the news we had"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Only news I have is medical - Dysentery's going around the church camp - boil everything, and I mean everything"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I keep a list of names people give me, that's the only news I trust - is there a name you want written on it?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,9999|world=vehicle",{"Last BOLO we got was a white pickup, occupants bitten - that was day three, everything since is secondhand"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"State radio's quiet, only traffic I pick up is other folks asking the same thing you are"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|world=window",{"Word from a unit out of Rosewood is the county jail's overrun - stay clear of anything with bars on the windows"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I don't share information with people I haven't cleared - step back"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nothing I can share, nothing worth sharing, if that helps any"}},
{"ASK_NEWS","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly|day=8,9999",{"Perimeter's shrinking, that's the news - you didn't hear it from me"}},
