{"ASK_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Don't go out in the dark, don't light a fire, don't make a sound, just sit tight until morning","Nights are bad, worse than you'd believe, I don't go out after dark","I hate the dark, I've always hated the dark, but now it has teeth"}},
{"ASK_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,20",{"Night is worse, I'll tell you that, so find shelter before dusk, and don't be out when the sun goes down","Daytime is better... but not safe -- just better, at night they seem to know where you are","By dusk I'm locked in, with the lights off, and the radio off, and my breath held"}},
{"ASK_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"They come out at night, or maybe they're always out, we just can't see 'em in the dark","Safe at night? no, nothing's safe at night, but quiet beats loud, and dark beats light, that's how I get through it","I'd stay put if I were you. Keep your voice down, and don't light yourself up for somebody to see"}},
{"ASK_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|hour=16,5",{"Why? you planning on being out after dark?","If you're working up to asking to stay with me tonight, the answer is no"}},
